Subject: [PATCH] fix(provenance): pin DS-000028/30 .gitattributes rows to
 ingestion-time blob; freeze-label universe snapshot

DS-000028-F020 and DS-000030-F019 fingerprint the 627-byte .gitattributes blob
introduced at 59cf2185 (2026-09-22); the file later legitimately grew. Pin both
rows to that blob (same mechanism as the other mutable snapshots) with a
tamper-detection regression test. Add SNAPSHOT_NOTICE.md for the 2026-10-21
universe CSV and a completion-consistency test across live projections.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
